  {
    "id": 442769634,
    "tag_name": "2.5.5",
    "name": "Updater CE 2.5.5 for Windows and Linux",
    "body": "Enforces that original software or Reborn is installed first to prevent user error from rendering device non-operational. Y2 Reborn requires you to be running the original firmware on your Y2 before installing, or it won't boot. \r\n\r\nThis update ensures that you always install the correct software before installing Y2reborn to prevent these issues, when installs are applied via either the SP Flash Tool (Windows/Linux) or MTKclient (Mac/Linux) engines the tool will ensure the user first answers a firmware sanity-check question before guiding the user through the install of Y2Reborn from the start, all the way up to enabling Wi-Fi and Bluetooth on the device.",
